1
00:00:42,292 --> 00:00:44,961
HIERARCHY

2
00:01:18,411 --> 00:01:21,247
Good morning. Nakatulog ka?

3
00:01:32,133 --> 00:01:33,384
Gising na.

4
00:01:42,310 --> 00:01:43,436
Nakatulog ka?

5
00:01:44,312 --> 00:01:45,146
Oo.

6
00:01:59,244 --> 00:02:00,245
Wag kang magpa-late.

7
00:02:05,083 --> 00:02:07,043
-Magkita tayo sa school.
-Okay.

8
00:02:28,690 --> 00:02:31,568
EPISODE 2
SECRET: WITHIN A SECRET

9
00:02:41,828 --> 00:02:44,080
Mag-break na tayo, Ri-an.

10
00:04:22,178 --> 00:04:23,429
Sana maayos kayong lahat.

11
00:04:23,513 --> 00:04:24,847
Ibigay n'yo na, please.

12
00:04:31,229 --> 00:04:32,730
Salamat po, Chairwoman An.

13
00:04:34,190 --> 00:04:35,984
Akala ko next month pa kayo darating.

14
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:40,196
Ri-an, anak ko.

15
00:04:40,280 --> 00:04:41,447
Okay ka lang ba?

16
00:04:42,031 --> 00:04:44,617
Maaga akong natapos sa Singapore
kaya ilang araw ako dito.

17
00:04:44,701 --> 00:04:46,995
Kumusta sa school?

18
00:04:47,662 --> 00:04:48,746
Senior ka na.

19
00:04:48,830 --> 00:04:51,082
Malapit ka nang mag-college.

20
00:04:52,417 --> 00:04:55,086
Ang bilis mong lumaki.
Nagiging nostalgic tuloy ako.

21
00:04:56,963 --> 00:04:57,797
Junior ako.

22
00:04:58,631 --> 00:04:59,465
Ano?

23
00:04:59,549 --> 00:05:01,592
Isang taon pa bago graduation ko.

24
00:05:03,386 --> 00:05:04,470
Maganda 'yon.

25
00:05:04,554 --> 00:05:06,806
Saan mo gustong mag-college?

26
00:05:06,889 --> 00:05:09,684
Sa tingin ko the best ang UK.

27
00:05:09,767 --> 00:05:10,601
Ay.

28
00:05:11,936 --> 00:05:14,272
-Tingnan natin 'yong schedule ko.
-Yes, ma'am.

29
00:05:20,361 --> 00:05:24,240
Lunch kasama 'yong board sa tanghali,
Jooshin Gallery sa alas-dos.

30
00:05:24,324 --> 00:05:25,658
Jooshin Hotel, alas-kuwatro.

31
00:05:25,742 --> 00:05:28,119
Ano pa'ng nandiyan?

32
00:05:28,202 --> 00:05:29,746
'Yong meeting kay Direktor An.

33
00:05:30,496 --> 00:05:32,874
-Sasaglit ako pagkatapos ng lunch.
-Noted po.

34
00:05:32,957 --> 00:05:35,293
Maliban sa panahon, perfect ang London.

35
00:05:35,793 --> 00:05:37,253
Pumili ka ng school sa UK.

36
00:05:37,337 --> 00:05:38,629
Di ka magsisisi.

37
00:05:38,713 --> 00:05:42,216
Tatlong buwan na nang huli kitang nakita
at isang taon mula no'ng kumain tayo.

38
00:05:43,384 --> 00:05:45,178
Wala ka bang pakialam kung okay ako,

39
00:05:45,261 --> 00:05:48,097
kung kumakain ako nang maayos,
o kung malusog ako?

40
00:05:48,181 --> 00:05:52,643
Nasa edad ako na kailangan ko pa
ng atensiyon ng mga magulang ko.

41
00:05:53,436 --> 00:05:55,897
Sino'ng staff ang in charge
sa pag-aalaga kay Ri-an?

42
00:05:55,980 --> 00:05:57,607
Anim na tutor, dalawang assistant,

43
00:05:57,690 --> 00:06:00,443
tatlong health specialist,
at apat na dietician.

44
00:06:01,694 --> 00:06:03,321
Ano'ng atensiyon pa ang kulang?

45
00:06:11,829 --> 00:06:15,666
Mag-set tayo ng meeting kay President Ryu
bago 'yong board meeting.

46
00:06:15,750 --> 00:06:16,751
Yes, ma'am.

47
00:06:46,197 --> 00:06:47,156
Tae-ho!

48
00:06:48,574 --> 00:06:49,409
Uy!

49
00:06:51,244 --> 00:06:53,079
Ano'ng nangyayari dito?

50
00:06:53,162 --> 00:06:53,996
Anong…

51
00:06:54,831 --> 00:06:56,874
Hoy, hampaslupa. Ba't mo 'ko hinahawakan?

52
00:07:00,420 --> 00:07:01,546
Uy, Tae-ho.

53
00:07:06,509 --> 00:07:08,719
Wala ka talagang alam, 'no?

54
00:07:08,803 --> 00:07:10,596
-Kilala mo siya?
-Imposible.

55
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:13,599
Kilala niya 'yong nag-iisang anak
ng may-ari ng Jaeyul Hotel?

56
00:07:13,683 --> 00:07:14,809
Hoy, scholar.

57
00:07:14,892 --> 00:07:16,978
Di dahil schoolmates tayo,
magkaibigan na tayo.

58
00:07:18,855 --> 00:07:20,440
-Tumatawa ka? Wow.
-Tumawa siya.

59
00:07:20,523 --> 00:07:24,444
Ang lakas ng loob mong hawakan sa balikat
'yong isang maharlika tapos tumawa ka pa?

60
00:07:24,527 --> 00:07:26,988
Kawawang Tae-ho.
Pa'no kung mabulok 'yong balikat niya?

61
00:07:27,989 --> 00:07:30,366
Ta-da!

62
00:07:30,450 --> 00:07:31,993
Di nga. Dumating talaga siya?

63
00:07:32,076 --> 00:07:34,829
Pag nakita siya ni Ri-an,
baka i-unbox niya 'yong tiyan niya.

64
00:07:34,912 --> 00:07:36,706
Ibang klase talaga siya.

65
00:07:36,789 --> 00:07:38,291
Ano ba'ng nangyari no'n?

66
00:07:38,374 --> 00:07:41,210
Di ba nakatayo lang si Jae-i
no'ng halikan siya ng scholar?

67
00:07:41,294 --> 00:07:42,420
Baka sila na?

68
00:07:42,503 --> 00:07:45,089
Di pwede. Isang hamak na scholar
at si Jae-i?

69
00:07:45,173 --> 00:07:46,048
Imposible 'yon.

70
00:07:46,132 --> 00:07:47,341
Di ba, He-ra?

71
00:07:49,677 --> 00:07:51,220
Di naman imposible 'yon.

72
00:07:51,304 --> 00:07:54,765
Scholar o hindi,
ang mahalaga gusto siya ni Jae-i.

73
00:07:54,849 --> 00:07:55,933
Nakakabilib kaya.

74
00:07:56,017 --> 00:08:00,021
'Yong tapang na magkagusto sa isang tao
nang di pansin 'yong status o background.

75
00:08:00,104 --> 00:08:00,980
Talaga?

76
00:08:01,063 --> 00:08:03,858
E, ikaw, He-ra? Okay lang
kahit sinong lalaki basta gusto mo?

77
00:08:03,941 --> 00:08:04,984
Iba ako.

78
00:08:05,067 --> 00:08:08,070
Ayoko sa mga lalaking mas mahina
at di mayaman.

79
00:08:08,654 --> 00:08:10,031
Nasa DNA ko lang.

80
00:08:10,531 --> 00:08:12,200
Uy. Parating na siya.

81
00:08:40,770 --> 00:08:42,647
Lagot ka pag kinalaban mo sila.

82
00:08:42,730 --> 00:08:44,857
Totoo 'yong sinabi ni Chan-min
noong isang araw.

83
00:08:44,941 --> 00:08:45,942
'Yong namatay.

84
00:08:46,025 --> 00:08:47,443
Kinalaban niya si Ri-an.

85
00:08:48,402 --> 00:08:50,238
Sabi nila hit-and-run.

86
00:08:50,821 --> 00:08:53,282
Pero tumakbo siya sa kalsada
kasi takot ma-bully.

87
00:08:54,659 --> 00:08:56,202
O sinadya siyang sagasaan.

88
00:08:57,245 --> 00:09:00,164
Ano'ng ginawa ng batang 'yon
para magalit si Ri-an?

89
00:09:00,790 --> 00:09:02,124
Dahil kay Jae-i.

90
00:09:02,208 --> 00:09:04,502
Nakipagkaibigan siya sa kanya.

91
00:09:04,585 --> 00:09:06,254
-'Yon lang?
-"'Yon lang"?

92
00:09:06,337 --> 00:09:11,175
Girlfriend ni Ri-an si Jae-i.
Siya lang ang Achilles heel ni Kim Ri-an.

93
00:09:44,959 --> 00:09:46,043
May tanong lang ako.

94
00:09:46,544 --> 00:09:48,296
Ba't ba ang extreme mo pag kasama ako?

95
00:09:48,379 --> 00:09:49,589
Anong klaseng extreme?

96
00:09:50,756 --> 00:09:51,966
'Yong kiss?

97
00:09:54,218 --> 00:09:56,304
"Mag-break na tayo. Maging kaibigan tayo."

98
00:09:56,846 --> 00:09:58,973
Malinaw kong sinabi 'yong nararamdaman ko.

99
00:09:59,056 --> 00:10:01,392
Wala ka nang pakialam
kung sino'ng gusto ko

100
00:10:02,393 --> 00:10:03,644
o anong gawin ko sa kanila.

101
00:10:03,728 --> 00:10:04,562
Gusto mo siya?

102
00:10:05,813 --> 00:10:06,772
'Yong scholar?

103
00:10:08,566 --> 00:10:09,775
Ano kayang dahilan

104
00:10:10,276 --> 00:10:12,820
para gumamit ka ng walang kamuwang-muwang

105
00:10:14,113 --> 00:10:15,990
para makipag-break sa 'kin.

106
00:10:17,450 --> 00:10:19,452
'Yong dahilan na gusto mong itago.

107
00:10:19,535 --> 00:10:21,329
Kailangan kong malaman, Jung Jae-i.

108
00:10:22,747 --> 00:10:23,956
At dahil doon,

109
00:10:24,665 --> 00:10:26,667
di ko alam ang magagawa ko.

110
00:10:28,044 --> 00:10:31,714
Handa akong gawin lahat, anumang paraan,

111
00:10:34,050 --> 00:10:37,094
hanggang malaman ko
'yong tinatago mo sa 'kin

112
00:10:37,178 --> 00:10:39,430
at bumalik ka sa nararapat mong lugar.

113
00:10:58,199 --> 00:11:00,076
Tahimik ko siyang tuturuan ng leksiyon.

114
00:11:00,576 --> 00:11:03,496
Wag tahimik. Durugin mo siya nang husto.

115
00:11:04,955 --> 00:11:09,335
Kailangan niyang malaman 'yong kabayaran
ng pangingialam sa pag-aari ko.

116
00:11:09,418 --> 00:11:11,629
Di ba dapat mag-lie low tayo?

117
00:11:11,712 --> 00:11:13,631
Kailan lang namatay 'yong lalaking 'yon.

118
00:11:16,300 --> 00:11:19,470
Ako na ang bahala
at sisiguraduhin kong gagapang siya.

119
00:11:23,057 --> 00:11:24,767
Simula ngayon,

120
00:11:24,850 --> 00:11:28,020
sinumang kikilala sa bagong scholar

121
00:11:28,104 --> 00:11:29,355
o kausapin man lang siya,

122
00:11:30,064 --> 00:11:31,524
ituturing na kapantay niya.

123
00:11:32,858 --> 00:11:33,943
Chan-min.

124
00:11:35,528 --> 00:11:38,114
Di ko na dapat sabihin sa 'yong
asikasuhin mo 'to.

125
00:11:38,197 --> 00:11:40,658
Gaano katagal ko pa ba ipapaliwanag lahat?

126
00:11:40,741 --> 00:11:42,702
Nahihiya akong matawag na senior.

127
00:11:42,785 --> 00:11:45,579
Nag-iisip na ako ng plano
para turuan siya ng leksiyon.

128
00:11:54,839 --> 00:11:55,840
Seryoso kayo?

129
00:11:56,424 --> 00:11:59,009
Sino'ng nagpaplano
sa harap ng pinagpaplanuhan nila?

130
00:12:00,136 --> 00:12:01,762
-Di ba?
-Tarantado ka.

131
00:12:01,846 --> 00:12:03,222
Gusto mong mamatay?

132
00:12:05,850 --> 00:12:08,018
Kasasabi lang ni Yun-seok
na wag akong kausapin.

133
00:12:08,102 --> 00:12:09,353
Di mo siya narinig?

134
00:12:10,146 --> 00:12:11,147
'Tong baliw na gagong…

135
00:12:15,109 --> 00:12:18,404
Chan-min, di ako ang dapat mong saktan.

136
00:12:18,487 --> 00:12:20,114
-Si Yun-seok dapat.
-Hoy!

137
00:12:20,823 --> 00:12:23,743
-Di ba?
-'Yong buto ko!

138
00:12:23,826 --> 00:12:25,035
Walanghiya ka!

139
00:12:25,119 --> 00:12:26,412
Anong ginagawa n'yo?

140
00:12:29,248 --> 00:12:30,875
Katarantaduhan 'to…

141
00:12:34,003 --> 00:12:34,962
Lintik!

142
00:12:36,255 --> 00:12:37,548
Ano'ng nangyayari?

143
00:12:40,676 --> 00:12:41,510
Senior?

144
00:12:42,595 --> 00:12:43,846
Ano'ng ginagawa mo dito?

145
00:12:45,890 --> 00:12:47,600
Buwisit. Nakakahiya.

146
00:12:54,648 --> 00:12:56,609
May announcement lang ako.

147
00:12:56,692 --> 00:12:59,612
Tuloy 'yong Healing Forest ngayong taon.

148
00:12:59,695 --> 00:13:02,156
Siguraduhing tingnan 'yong notice
sa group chat.

149
00:13:02,782 --> 00:13:05,451
Sabihan n'yo ako agad
kung di kayo makaka-attend.

150
00:13:06,869 --> 00:13:07,703
‘Yon lang.

151
00:13:15,628 --> 00:13:16,462
Jae-i.

152
00:13:19,465 --> 00:13:21,300
Pwede ba tayong mag-usap?

153
00:13:24,595 --> 00:13:25,679
Magsalita ka.

154
00:13:28,098 --> 00:13:28,933
Sabihin mo na.

155
00:13:29,016 --> 00:13:30,309
Di na mahalaga.

156
00:13:34,188 --> 00:13:35,356
Narinig mo siya.

157
00:13:39,109 --> 00:13:41,237
Sorry no'ng isang araw.

158
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:45,533
Kung nagulat ka o na-offend…

159
00:13:45,616 --> 00:13:46,492
Scholar.

160
00:13:46,575 --> 00:13:47,785
Kang Ha ang pangalan ko.

161
00:13:49,328 --> 00:13:52,331
-Di "scholar." Kang Ha.
-Kahit ano'ng pangalan mo.

162
00:13:52,414 --> 00:13:54,792
Nagsaya lang tayo sa party.
Wag kang mag-overreact.

163
00:13:54,875 --> 00:13:56,418
Ayoko sa mga taong clingy.

164
00:13:57,670 --> 00:13:59,588
A, pwede kitang bigyan ng advice?

165
00:14:00,089 --> 00:14:02,800
Para 'to sa shirt na pinahiram mo,
kaya makinig ka.

166
00:14:08,973 --> 00:14:09,932
Mag-drop ka na.

167
00:14:10,015 --> 00:14:10,850
"Mag-drop"?

168
00:14:12,101 --> 00:14:13,477
Ba't ako magda-drop?

169
00:14:13,561 --> 00:14:17,189
Ginalit mo si Ri-an, at 'yon lang
ang paraan para malabanan mo siya.

170
00:14:21,026 --> 00:14:23,529
Kung 'yon ang ibig mong sabihin,
ako na ang bahala.

171
00:14:23,612 --> 00:14:24,446
At saka…

172
00:14:26,657 --> 00:14:27,491
nagustuhan ko.

173
00:14:29,285 --> 00:14:30,870
Na ikaw 'yong nandoon no'n

174
00:14:32,037 --> 00:14:33,789
at di mo ako tinulak.

175
00:14:34,623 --> 00:14:35,457
Nagustuhan ko.

176
00:14:45,676 --> 00:14:46,760
Gusto ko 'yan,

177
00:14:46,844 --> 00:14:49,013
'yong pag-ibig sa kabila ng status.

178
00:14:50,723 --> 00:14:54,018
Pero ba't mo pinili si Jae-i?
Ang daming babae no'n.

179
00:14:54,101 --> 00:14:55,269
Kasi maganda siya.

180
00:14:55,352 --> 00:14:56,353
Ano?

181
00:14:58,147 --> 00:14:59,440
Siya 'yong pinakamaganda.

182
00:15:00,149 --> 00:15:01,025
No'ng araw na 'yon.

183
00:15:02,568 --> 00:15:03,819
Sa dami ng babae.

184
00:15:08,657 --> 00:15:09,575
'Yon lang?

185
00:15:11,619 --> 00:15:15,205
Itinaya mo 'yong buhay mo
dahil lang maganda siya?

186
00:15:29,970 --> 00:15:31,680
Pakiramdam ko dapat may gawin ako.

187
00:15:32,181 --> 00:15:33,015
Sorry.

188
00:15:33,974 --> 00:15:34,975
Kung anuman 'yon.

189
00:15:36,226 --> 00:15:37,561
Sorry sa lahat.

190
00:15:51,867 --> 00:15:53,494
Ano'ng itsura ko? Cool, di ba?

191
00:15:55,162 --> 00:15:56,330
Bagay na bagay sa 'yo.

192
00:15:56,413 --> 00:15:58,332
Tara. Ihahatid na kita.

193
00:15:59,208 --> 00:16:00,209
Tara na?

194
00:16:08,634 --> 00:16:10,135
Nakuhanan ko lahat.

195
00:16:27,945 --> 00:16:29,238
Ano'ng kinakain mo?

196
00:16:29,321 --> 00:16:31,198
-Ice cream.
-Ikaw lang?

197
00:16:31,281 --> 00:16:33,033
-Isa lang 'yong kutsara.
-Heto.

198
00:16:34,994 --> 00:16:35,953
Nganga.

199
00:16:36,578 --> 00:16:38,497
Lapit ka para maisubo ko sa 'yo.

200
00:16:39,331 --> 00:16:40,791
Akin na. Ano ba!

201
00:16:41,625 --> 00:16:42,459
Uy!

202
00:16:42,543 --> 00:16:43,502
Uy, ikaw!

203
00:16:45,462 --> 00:16:46,422
Uy!

204
00:16:47,256 --> 00:16:48,090
Uy.

205
00:16:50,551 --> 00:16:53,053
Suko ka na? Wag mong pakialaman
'yong pagkain ng iba.

206
00:16:54,096 --> 00:16:55,597
Mamili ka. Ice cream o ako.

207
00:16:55,681 --> 00:16:56,598
Ice cream.

208
00:16:57,391 --> 00:16:58,392
Halika dito.

209
00:16:59,727 --> 00:17:00,811
Ibibigay ko sa 'yo.

210
00:17:04,523 --> 00:17:06,942
Nganga. Lakihan mo pa.
Uy, lumapit ka para masubo mo.

211
00:17:07,026 --> 00:17:08,986
Ano ba! Uy!

212
00:17:09,069 --> 00:17:10,279
Kasalanan mo o hindi?

213
00:17:10,362 --> 00:17:12,156
-Kasalanan ko.
-Aamin ka na?

214
00:17:12,239 --> 00:17:13,490
Kasalanan ko nga.

215
00:17:14,074 --> 00:17:15,826
-Teka.
-Bakit?

216
00:17:15,909 --> 00:17:18,328
Talagang bubugbugin mo 'ko
dahil sa pagkain?

217
00:17:18,412 --> 00:17:20,831
-Kasi nakialam ka.
-Ice cream o ako?

218
00:17:21,331 --> 00:17:22,791
-Siyempre, ano…
-Siyempre?

219
00:17:22,875 --> 00:17:24,376
-Siyempre…
-Siyempre?

220
00:17:24,460 --> 00:17:26,170
-Ice cream.
-Naiiyak ka na, 'no?

221
00:17:27,796 --> 00:17:28,797
Halika dito. Uy!

222
00:17:28,881 --> 00:17:30,507
Napaka-loyal at romantic mo talaga.

223
00:17:31,300 --> 00:17:32,676
Di na maganda 'yan.

224
00:17:38,474 --> 00:17:39,975
Nasa labas ng hotel si Jae-i.

225
00:17:47,775 --> 00:17:50,778
Narinig mo ba 'yong sinabi ko?
Di na maganda 'yan.

226
00:17:51,487 --> 00:17:54,907
Isa pa, ayaw ni Jae-i ng mga taong clingy.

227
00:18:02,289 --> 00:18:03,916
Gumamit ka ng ibang paraan.

228
00:18:05,250 --> 00:18:06,293
Ibang paraan?

229
00:18:06,877 --> 00:18:08,796
Mag-date ka ng iba, Ri-an.

230
00:18:11,715 --> 00:18:13,550
Mula noong 15 kayo… Hindi.

231
00:18:13,634 --> 00:18:17,513
Minahal niya simula six years old
si Jae-i, ngayon may iba na si Ri-an?

232
00:18:18,097 --> 00:18:19,890
Di ko kakayanin 'yon.

233
00:18:19,973 --> 00:18:22,226
Babalikan kita o aagawin kita.

234
00:18:22,309 --> 00:18:25,270
-Dapat mag-date ako ng iba?
-Oo.

235
00:18:25,354 --> 00:18:27,022
O kahit magpanggap man lang.

236
00:18:28,273 --> 00:18:32,945
May feelings pa rin si Jae-i sa 'yo.
Kaya siya pumunta dito.

237
00:18:33,445 --> 00:18:36,907
Ang sinasabi ko, tigilan mo na
'yong paghabol at magplano ka.

238
00:18:37,449 --> 00:18:38,575
'Yon ang best chance mo.

239
00:18:40,619 --> 00:18:41,537
Kung gano'n…

240
00:18:46,416 --> 00:18:47,251
dapat

241
00:18:48,669 --> 00:18:49,795
alamin mo.

242
00:18:53,340 --> 00:18:54,633
Alamin ang ano?

243
00:18:55,425 --> 00:18:58,929
'Yong totoong dahilan
ng pakikipag-break sa 'kin ni Jae-i.

244
00:19:05,144 --> 00:19:06,395
Mahirap 'yon.

245
00:19:07,271 --> 00:19:10,732
Gusto kong magkabalikan kayo,
pero best friend ako ni Jae-i.

246
00:19:10,816 --> 00:19:12,192
Di ako pwedeng maging spy.

247
00:19:48,687 --> 00:19:50,063
-Uy.
-Tagal nating di nagkita.

248
00:19:52,107 --> 00:19:53,358
Sabihin mo na sa 'kin.

249
00:19:54,860 --> 00:19:56,445
Sabihin ang ano?

250
00:19:56,528 --> 00:19:58,530
Ramdam ko may secret kang
di pwedeng sabihin.

251
00:19:59,489 --> 00:20:00,991
Mabigat na pasanin 'yan.

252
00:20:01,825 --> 00:20:02,743
Tutulungan kita.

253
00:20:09,333 --> 00:20:10,167
Sandali lang.

254
00:20:11,084 --> 00:20:14,379
Mukhang di lang ako 'yong may secret
na di ko masabi.

255
00:20:18,425 --> 00:20:19,259
Babalik ako.

256
00:20:33,899 --> 00:20:35,484
Kung di mo ako papansinin,

257
00:20:35,567 --> 00:20:38,654
ipapadala ko rin 'to sa tatay mo.

258
00:20:45,827 --> 00:20:48,830
Ito ba 'yong email address ng secretary
ng Jaeyul Group?

259
00:21:09,351 --> 00:21:10,686
Akala ko tapos na.

260
00:21:11,186 --> 00:21:13,438
Sabi mo binura mo na lahat.
Di pa ba sapat 'yon?

261
00:21:23,991 --> 00:21:24,825
Sigurado ka ba

262
00:21:25,867 --> 00:21:26,868
dito?

263
00:21:26,952 --> 00:21:27,953
Sigurado ako.

264
00:21:28,036 --> 00:21:31,206
Dalawang beses kong tiningnan…
Hindi, tatlong beses, paulit-ulit.

265
00:21:32,499 --> 00:21:34,167
Ano na ngayon? Ano'ng gagawin ko?

266
00:21:34,251 --> 00:21:35,127
Ano'ng gagawin ko?

267
00:21:37,254 --> 00:21:38,255
Hanap tayo ng paraan.

268
00:21:39,089 --> 00:21:39,923
Paraan para saan?

269
00:21:40,007 --> 00:21:41,842
Ang hirap itago nito.

270
00:21:44,678 --> 00:21:47,806
-Jae-i.
-Wala kang idea kung ano 'yong papa ko.

271
00:21:48,974 --> 00:21:49,933
Pag nalaman niya,

272
00:21:50,017 --> 00:21:51,643
itatago niya ako gaya ng mama ko

273
00:21:52,144 --> 00:21:52,978
o papatayin ako.

274
00:21:55,772 --> 00:22:00,027
Mas mabuting mamatay ako bago 'to lumabas.

275
00:22:01,153 --> 00:22:02,154
Hanap tayo ng paraan.

276
00:22:02,821 --> 00:22:03,822
Tutulungan kita.

277
00:22:04,573 --> 00:22:06,074
Natatakot akong

278
00:22:06,158 --> 00:22:08,118
matulad sa nanay ko.

279
00:22:08,201 --> 00:22:09,953
Baka patayin ako ng papa ko.

280
00:22:22,257 --> 00:22:23,342
Ano 'yan?

281
00:22:27,929 --> 00:22:28,889
-Di mo…
-Jae-i?

282
00:22:29,931 --> 00:22:31,600
Ano? Hoy!

283
00:22:31,683 --> 00:22:33,602
-Ano'ng ginagawa mo dito?
-Jae-i.

284
00:22:33,685 --> 00:22:36,063
-Ano'ng ginagawa mo dito? Labas.
-Jae-i!

285
00:22:36,146 --> 00:22:37,272
Lumabas ka muna.

286
00:22:46,740 --> 00:22:50,243
Paano, Jung Jae-i?
Interesado ka na bang kausapin ako?

287
00:23:08,387 --> 00:23:09,846
-Aalis ka na?
-Oo.

288
00:23:09,930 --> 00:23:11,807
Pagod na ako. Umuwi ka na rin.

289
00:23:24,152 --> 00:23:25,487
Muntik na'ng tamaan.

290
00:23:26,029 --> 00:23:27,030
Muntik na, Papa.

291
00:23:42,212 --> 00:23:43,338
Chairman Jung.

292
00:23:47,676 --> 00:23:48,969
Ano 'yon? Ba't ka napatawag?

293
00:23:52,556 --> 00:23:53,390
Ano?

294
00:23:59,521 --> 00:24:00,605
Ano'ng lumabas?

295
00:24:04,317 --> 00:24:06,319
I-double-check 'yong detalye at maghintay.

296
00:24:15,787 --> 00:24:17,706
Ano'ng ibig sabihin nito, Jae-i?

297
00:24:22,335 --> 00:24:24,171
Di magagawa ng anak ko 'yon.

298
00:24:24,254 --> 00:24:25,088
Parang di tama.

299
00:24:25,172 --> 00:24:28,842
Gumaya ka sa nanay mo, kahit alam mo
'yong galit ko sa kabastusan niya?

300
00:24:28,925 --> 00:24:30,010
Di pwede.

301
00:24:30,552 --> 00:24:33,805
Tiwala akong di gagawa ng gano'n
'yong anak ko.

302
00:24:36,516 --> 00:24:37,517
Sagutin mo ako.

303
00:24:38,101 --> 00:24:40,103
Wag kang tumayo diyan na parang tanga!

304
00:24:46,610 --> 00:24:48,028
Sabi ko, sagutin mo ako!

305
00:24:51,907 --> 00:24:53,116
Kailangan ko nang umalis.

306
00:24:57,913 --> 00:24:59,706
May nangyari sa trabaho.

307
00:25:02,000 --> 00:25:03,752
Mukhang masamang balita.

308
00:25:03,835 --> 00:25:06,421
May kakaibang nai-post
sa forum ng mga board member.

309
00:25:07,088 --> 00:25:08,215
Kailangan kong tingnan.

310
00:25:10,884 --> 00:25:13,553
Matagal na tayong di nag-hunting
nang magkakasama,

311
00:25:13,637 --> 00:25:15,096
tapos sinira ko pa.

312
00:25:17,641 --> 00:25:18,975
Dahan-dahan kayo sa pagbaba.

313
00:25:35,825 --> 00:25:38,995
Tapos na. Ngayon, lemon zest…

314
00:25:40,121 --> 00:25:43,124
Ang agang tumawag ni Director Jang.

315
00:25:43,959 --> 00:25:45,585
Okay lang ba 'yong kumpanya?

316
00:25:46,419 --> 00:25:47,754
Siyempre, okay lang kami.

317
00:25:48,421 --> 00:25:50,215
May balita ka ba sa Jooshin?

318
00:25:52,592 --> 00:25:54,386
Malapit na kaming magkatrabaho.

319
00:25:56,137 --> 00:25:58,515
Uy, ngayon na ba ulit 'yon?

320
00:25:58,598 --> 00:26:00,642
Oo naman!

321
00:26:00,725 --> 00:26:04,563
'Yong araw na magagawan ko ng almusal
'yong anak ko!

322
00:26:10,402 --> 00:26:11,861
Puntahan mo ako sa bahay mamaya.

323
00:26:14,447 --> 00:26:15,907
Ba't niya ako inuutusan ulit?

324
00:26:18,618 --> 00:26:20,412
Nakakatawa.

325
00:26:23,206 --> 00:26:24,040
Hoy.

326
00:26:55,614 --> 00:26:57,324
May nilagay sila sa inumin ko.

327
00:26:58,742 --> 00:26:59,993
Malamang droga 'yon.

328
00:27:04,497 --> 00:27:05,832
Muntik na akong mamatay.

329
00:27:06,333 --> 00:27:07,208
Totoo.

330
00:27:09,085 --> 00:27:10,962
Sandali. In-han. Kumalma ka lang.

331
00:27:11,046 --> 00:27:13,048
Paano magkakadroga 'yong mga high school?

332
00:27:13,131 --> 00:27:14,215
Wala kang idea…

333
00:27:16,593 --> 00:27:18,303
kung anong klaseng lugar ang Jooshin…

334
00:27:20,722 --> 00:27:22,349
kung anong klaseng tao sila.

335
00:27:40,367 --> 00:27:42,827
Bigla bang tinanggal
'yong magulang mo sa Jooshin?

336
00:27:42,911 --> 00:27:44,913
O baka supplier
na di na nabigyan ng trabaho?

337
00:27:44,996 --> 00:27:48,583
Sino ka ba para matakot ako sa 'yo?

338
00:27:48,667 --> 00:27:51,503
Sabi nila, si Kim Ri-an ang batas
at ang sentro ng Jooshin.

339
00:27:52,504 --> 00:27:54,589
Maabot ko man
o masira 'yong sentrong 'yon,

340
00:27:55,590 --> 00:27:57,676
pinipilit ko lang mag-survive dito.

341
00:27:57,759 --> 00:27:58,718
"Maabot"

342
00:28:00,053 --> 00:28:00,887
o "masira"?

343
00:28:07,435 --> 00:28:10,563
Di ko alam
'yong totoong motibo mo dito, scholar,

344
00:28:12,023 --> 00:28:12,857
pero gawin mo.

345
00:28:15,151 --> 00:28:16,820
Kung ano man 'yon, kung kaya mo.

346
00:28:21,199 --> 00:28:23,201
Karahasan. Bullying.

347
00:28:24,619 --> 00:28:25,912
Si Kim Ri-an ang may pakana.

348
00:28:27,664 --> 00:28:29,499
Siya rin kaya 'yong nasa likod ng drugs?

349
00:28:47,142 --> 00:28:50,270
Kailangang mangyari 'yon
sa Healing Forest, kundi patay tayo.

350
00:28:50,770 --> 00:28:54,274
Pero di man lang siya natinag
noong sinuntok mo siya.

351
00:28:54,357 --> 00:28:55,984
Pa'no natin siya itataboy?

352
00:28:56,484 --> 00:28:58,236
Kailangan lang natin siyang takutin.

353
00:28:58,319 --> 00:28:59,779
Bubugbugin natin siya

354
00:29:00,864 --> 00:29:03,992
o mawala siya
gaya no'ng gagong Kang In-han na 'yon.

355
00:29:05,076 --> 00:29:07,787
Wala namang papansin
kung may isa pang outcast na mamatay.

356
00:29:07,871 --> 00:29:10,248
Tigilan mo 'yang phone mo
pag kausap ka ng senior mo.

357
00:29:10,874 --> 00:29:12,917
Dapat gulpihin na lang
'tong mga tangang 'to.

358
00:29:13,752 --> 00:29:19,215
PRINCIPAL'S OFFICE

359
00:29:34,147 --> 00:29:35,899
Pinabibigay po ng teacher ko.

360
00:29:36,399 --> 00:29:37,233
Okay.

361
00:29:38,485 --> 00:29:41,446
Kumusta? Nakakasundo mo ba lahat?

362
00:29:42,363 --> 00:29:43,907
Ano po'ng ibig n'yong sabihin?

363
00:29:43,990 --> 00:29:48,203
Sina Ri-an, Jae-i, Woo-jin, He-ra.
'Yong mga kaibigan mo, siyempre.

364
00:29:48,787 --> 00:29:49,704
Kaibigan?

365
00:29:51,748 --> 00:29:52,624
Okay naman sila.

366
00:29:52,707 --> 00:29:54,834
Wag kang sumama
sa mga walang kuwentang bata.

367
00:29:54,918 --> 00:29:57,629
Pang-habambuhay na
'yong mga magiging kaibigan mo dito.

368
00:29:58,338 --> 00:30:00,465
Makakatulong sila pag nagtrabaho ka na.

369
00:30:00,965 --> 00:30:02,926
Alam mo 'yong ibig kong sabihin, di ba?

370
00:30:04,803 --> 00:30:05,804
Opo.

371
00:30:10,350 --> 00:30:11,184
Pero, Ma…

372
00:30:13,603 --> 00:30:14,813
pa'no mo tinago?

373
00:30:17,649 --> 00:30:18,817
Ang pagkamatay ni In-han.

374
00:30:19,818 --> 00:30:21,903
Wala ni isang article na lumabas.

375
00:30:23,071 --> 00:30:24,072
Curious lang ako.

376
00:30:26,783 --> 00:30:28,785
Di ko alam kung ano'ng sinasabi mo.

377
00:30:29,661 --> 00:30:31,037
Male-late ka na sa klase.

378
00:30:49,722 --> 00:30:50,682
Please, buksan n'yo.

379
00:30:50,765 --> 00:30:53,059
Naglagay ng droga si Ri-an
sa locker ni Yun-seok.

380
00:30:56,771 --> 00:30:59,983
Labag sa patakaran
'yong magbukas ng locker ng estudyante.

381
00:31:00,066 --> 00:31:01,359
Nilalabag nito ang privacy.

382
00:31:01,442 --> 00:31:04,362
Pag di mo 'yon binuksan, magrereklamo ako.

383
00:31:04,445 --> 00:31:05,697
Magrereklamo?

384
00:31:06,322 --> 00:31:08,700
-Tungkol saan?
-Nakita mong pinagtulungan ako.

385
00:31:09,200 --> 00:31:10,159
Pero binalewala mo.

386
00:31:13,496 --> 00:31:14,330
Kang Ha.

387
00:31:15,081 --> 00:31:16,416
Maliit na society ang school.

388
00:31:16,499 --> 00:31:17,500
Sa Jooshin,

389
00:31:17,584 --> 00:31:21,880
tinutulungan namin kayo gamit ang kalayaan
na lutasin 'yong maliliit na issue.

390
00:31:23,089 --> 00:31:24,841
Tinutulungan kami? Gamit ang ano?

391
00:31:24,924 --> 00:31:28,803
"Sila 'yong mga anak
ng kumpanyang pagtatrabahuhan n'yo."

392
00:31:28,887 --> 00:31:32,640
"Mahirap ka at dapat alam mo
'yong lugar mo at gumapang sa harap nila."

393
00:31:33,474 --> 00:31:36,352
Wag mong sabihing 'yon ang tulong
na sinasabi mo.

394
00:31:36,436 --> 00:31:38,396
-Kang Ha!
-Pupunta ako sa press.

395
00:31:38,479 --> 00:31:41,316
Sasabihin ko 'yong pananakit
at 'yong mga patakaran ng Jooshin.

396
00:31:41,816 --> 00:31:42,650
Lahat.

397
00:32:31,115 --> 00:32:31,991
Boo!

398
00:32:32,075 --> 00:32:33,117
Tinakot mo 'ko.

399
00:32:33,201 --> 00:32:35,370
Gutom ako. Bilhan mo 'ko ng yogurt.

400
00:32:35,453 --> 00:32:36,454
-Yogurt?
-Oo.

401
00:32:37,288 --> 00:32:38,957
-Tara sa cafe. Sige.
-Strawberry?

402
00:32:51,052 --> 00:32:53,221
Ito ba 'yong sinasabi mo?

403
00:32:53,304 --> 00:32:55,598
Asikasuhin mo 'to sa opisyal na paraan.

404
00:32:55,682 --> 00:32:58,977
Alamin mo kung ano'ng klaseng droga
'tong mga ito, kanino binibigay,

405
00:33:00,269 --> 00:33:01,521
at 'yong gumagamit nito.

406
00:33:01,604 --> 00:33:02,772
Xanax 'to.

407
00:33:03,898 --> 00:33:05,733
Antidepressant 'to.

408
00:33:06,567 --> 00:33:08,861
Baka di mo alam
kasi galing ka sa normal na school,

409
00:33:08,945 --> 00:33:11,990
pero kailangan 'to ng mga bata dito
dahil grabe 'yong pressure.

410
00:33:14,075 --> 00:33:17,078
Kung di ka naniniwala,
dalhin mo 'to sa ospital o police station.

411
00:33:21,165 --> 00:33:23,001
Pero ibalik mo bago may makaalam.

412
00:33:26,379 --> 00:33:27,672
Para di ka magkaproblema.

413
00:33:39,892 --> 00:33:42,020
Alam mo kung paano malaman
'yong nagpapadala

414
00:33:42,103 --> 00:33:43,771
ng anonymous DM sa Insta, di ba?

415
00:33:44,605 --> 00:33:45,440
Di ako sigurado.

416
00:33:46,232 --> 00:33:47,108
Ba't mo natanong?

417
00:33:47,191 --> 00:33:50,361
Sabi mo may alam kang
magaling na law firm, di ba?

418
00:33:51,237 --> 00:33:52,697
Well, 'yon, alam ko 'yon.

419
00:33:52,780 --> 00:33:55,742
May kinasuhang internet trolls
si Eun-gyeong gamit 'yong firm.

420
00:33:56,492 --> 00:33:59,620
Balita ko ayaw ng head office
na nilalabas 'yong account details.

421
00:33:59,704 --> 00:34:01,289
Mahirap hanapin 'yong anonymous.

422
00:34:01,372 --> 00:34:03,958
Okay lang kahit ilegal 'yong paraan.

423
00:34:04,584 --> 00:34:06,669
Hanap ka ng makaka-trace
ng anonymous accounts.

424
00:34:09,547 --> 00:34:10,882
Pa'no ko gagawin 'yon?

425
00:34:12,091 --> 00:34:14,844
Mas malawak 'yong social circle mo at…

426
00:34:14,927 --> 00:34:16,804
No'ng birthday party ni Woo-jin,

427
00:34:18,389 --> 00:34:19,432
may ni-record na video.

428
00:34:20,725 --> 00:34:21,559
Video?

429
00:34:21,642 --> 00:34:23,478
Merong may hawak no'n.

430
00:34:24,145 --> 00:34:25,146
Teka.

431
00:34:25,855 --> 00:34:27,065
Sino'ng may hawak?

432
00:34:27,148 --> 00:34:29,067
At pa'no? Ano'ng ni-record?

433
00:34:30,026 --> 00:34:31,486
Masama ba?

434
00:34:31,569 --> 00:34:35,573
May bagay ba sa party na 'yon
na okay lang i-record at i-share?

435
00:34:36,699 --> 00:34:38,284
Meron ba kahit isa?

436
00:34:42,914 --> 00:34:45,458
Gawin mo ang lahat para makahanap ng tao.

437
00:34:52,423 --> 00:34:54,050
Uy, ano sa tingin mo?

438
00:34:56,135 --> 00:34:57,303
Maganda.

439
00:34:57,386 --> 00:34:58,888
Pili ba ako ng isa pa?

440
00:34:58,971 --> 00:35:01,140
Gaano katagal 'yong Healing Forest
ngayong taon?

441
00:35:01,224 --> 00:35:02,350
Di ba isang araw?

442
00:35:02,433 --> 00:35:04,185
Sino 'yong lalaking 'yon?

443
00:35:05,311 --> 00:35:06,270
Si Kang…

444
00:35:07,980 --> 00:35:09,398
'Yong namatay na scholar.

445
00:35:09,482 --> 00:35:10,608
Kang In-han?

446
00:35:10,691 --> 00:35:12,777
Di ba namatay siya
sa araw ng party ni Woo-jin?

447
00:35:12,860 --> 00:35:14,278
Oo, no'ng araw na 'yon.

448
00:35:49,897 --> 00:35:52,066
Si Yoon He-ra 'to. Kumusta ka na?

449
00:35:52,775 --> 00:35:54,152
May kailangan akong tingnan.

450
00:36:28,352 --> 00:36:32,648
Ngayon, sisimulan na natin
'yong floating session.

451
00:36:32,732 --> 00:36:34,525
I-relax ang katawan at humiga…

452
00:36:41,616 --> 00:36:43,659
Huminga nang malalim.

453
00:36:43,743 --> 00:36:45,286
Inhale.

454
00:36:57,340 --> 00:36:58,174
Nice shot!

455
00:37:07,183 --> 00:37:08,809
Oo nga pala, sumama ba siya?

456
00:37:08,893 --> 00:37:09,727
'Yong puppy.

457
00:37:09,810 --> 00:37:10,645
Nakita ko siya.

458
00:37:11,979 --> 00:37:15,274
Tingin ko masasaktan nang husto
ngayong gabi si Kang Ha.

459
00:37:15,358 --> 00:37:16,400
Ngayong gabi?

460
00:37:16,484 --> 00:37:20,196
Sigurado akong may binabalik sina Chan-min
para mag-survive sila.

461
00:37:20,279 --> 00:37:21,739
Maganda kayang panoorin 'yon?

462
00:37:21,822 --> 00:37:22,823
Parang masaya 'yon.

463
00:37:22,907 --> 00:37:24,325
Gusto n'yo pustahan tayo?

464
00:37:25,201 --> 00:37:26,035
Pustahan?

465
00:37:26,535 --> 00:37:27,995
Tataya ako sa tapang ng scholar.

466
00:37:28,079 --> 00:37:29,956
Isang milyong won na abot siya bukas.

467
00:37:30,039 --> 00:37:32,166
Ako rin. Isang milyon
na tatagal siya bukas.

468
00:37:32,250 --> 00:37:34,710
Deal. Isang milyon na di niya kakayanin.

469
00:37:34,794 --> 00:37:36,170
Wala nang atrasan, ha?

470
00:37:37,171 --> 00:37:38,547
E, ikaw, Tae-ho?

471
00:37:41,926 --> 00:37:43,302
Isang milyon, di siya tatagal.

472
00:37:43,386 --> 00:37:45,846
Okay! Dalawang milyon pag natalo kayo.

473
00:37:45,930 --> 00:37:47,682
-Gawin mong lima.
-Limang milyong won?

474
00:37:47,765 --> 00:37:49,558
Dagdagan ko ng lima para maging sampu.

475
00:37:50,685 --> 00:37:52,603
Isipin mong regular school retreat 'to.

476
00:37:53,271 --> 00:37:57,275
Gamitin mo 'yong room na 'yon.
Mas maganda 'to kasi hiwalay sa main area.

477
00:37:57,358 --> 00:37:58,192
Okay.

478
00:37:58,276 --> 00:38:00,444
Pwede kang pumili
ng sessions mo sa info desk.

479
00:38:03,030 --> 00:38:04,031
Kung pwede,

480
00:38:04,657 --> 00:38:06,784
piliin mo 'yong konti lang
'yong estudyante.

481
00:38:06,867 --> 00:38:08,661
Thank you, class president.

482
00:38:09,287 --> 00:38:10,371
Trabaho lang.

483
00:38:11,747 --> 00:38:13,457
Wag mo akong kausapin pag may tao.

484
00:38:14,917 --> 00:38:16,210
Moss ang tawag nila sa akin.

485
00:38:17,586 --> 00:38:18,963
Kasi di ako napapansin.

486
00:38:19,547 --> 00:38:21,924
-Nakaka-offend…
-Di ako na-offend.

487
00:38:24,510 --> 00:38:26,929
Nakuha ko 'yon
kasi pinipilit kong wag mapansin.

488
00:38:27,680 --> 00:38:28,764
Ayokong…

489
00:38:30,975 --> 00:38:32,184
sirain 'yon ng kahit sino.

490
00:38:36,314 --> 00:38:37,565
Naiintindihan ko.

491
00:38:53,706 --> 00:38:55,166
Nag-request na ako para sa 'yo.

492
00:38:56,083 --> 00:38:57,460
Tungkol sa anonymous account,

493
00:38:57,543 --> 00:39:01,464
kung nasa party siya ni Woo-jin,
ibig sabihin kilala natin?

494
00:39:02,298 --> 00:39:05,092
Alam dapat nila
na di nila dapat gawin 'yon sa 'tin.

495
00:39:05,176 --> 00:39:06,052
Ano'ng gusto nila?

496
00:39:06,886 --> 00:39:09,764
Di ko talaga alam ano'ng gusto nila.

497
00:39:09,847 --> 00:39:12,641
Gusto ba nilang kumita
sa pagbabantang ilalabas nila 'yon?

498
00:39:12,725 --> 00:39:16,520
Pero walang tanga o desperado sa pera
na pupunta no'ng gabing 'yon.

499
00:39:17,772 --> 00:39:18,814
I-forward mo sa 'kin.

500
00:39:20,149 --> 00:39:21,025
Bigay ko sa kanya.

501
00:39:24,779 --> 00:39:27,239
Ako na'ng magbibigay ng account details.

502
00:39:31,952 --> 00:39:33,454
Ibig sabihin, may problema.

503
00:39:34,538 --> 00:39:37,833
Nakunan ka ring may ginagawa na di dapat.

504
00:39:42,338 --> 00:39:43,547
Gusto n'yong mag-brunch?

505
00:39:53,933 --> 00:39:57,937
Di pa ako kumakain,
pero parang di ako natunawan.

506
00:39:58,521 --> 00:40:01,065
-'Yong mood lang ba?
-Nakakahawa yata 'yan.

507
00:40:01,857 --> 00:40:02,942
Kasi ako rin.

508
00:40:03,818 --> 00:40:05,778
Ang tagal nating di nagsama nang ganito.

509
00:40:05,861 --> 00:40:07,279
Talagang ganito na lang kayo?

510
00:40:10,074 --> 00:40:11,200
Aalis na ako.

511
00:40:13,619 --> 00:40:14,954
Upo.

512
00:40:15,454 --> 00:40:16,580
Gusto mong friends tayo.

513
00:40:18,040 --> 00:40:20,334
Wala kang dahilan
para mailang o iwasan ako.

514
00:40:20,418 --> 00:40:22,128
Sabi mo di mo alam ang magagawa mo.

515
00:40:22,211 --> 00:40:25,047
Na gagawin mo lahat, anumang paraan.

516
00:40:30,928 --> 00:40:33,347
Di ba sapat 'yon para mailang ako?

517
00:40:37,351 --> 00:40:38,185
Uy, Jae-i!

518
00:40:39,603 --> 00:40:40,896
Ihahatid na kita.

519
00:40:51,240 --> 00:40:53,826
Napag-isipan mo ba 'yong sinabi ko?

520
00:40:56,287 --> 00:40:59,165
'Yong mag-date ng iba?
Wag na. Di 'yon gagana.

521
00:40:59,248 --> 00:41:02,042
Di siya maniniwala sa pagpapanggap ko
na may karelasyong iba.

522
00:41:02,793 --> 00:41:04,253
-Di si Jae-i.
-Maniniwala siya.

523
00:41:04,753 --> 00:41:05,880
Kung ako.

524
00:41:06,630 --> 00:41:07,590
Para sa 'yo.

525
00:41:09,550 --> 00:41:11,760
Ba't mo ilalagay 'yong sarili mo
sa gano'n?

526
00:41:12,511 --> 00:41:14,763
Kailangan ng taong kapani-paniwala
para kay Jae-i,

527
00:41:14,847 --> 00:41:18,642
isang taong gagawa ng sapat lang
para pagselosin siya, tapos aalis na.

528
00:41:18,726 --> 00:41:20,060
Ako lang ang meron ka.

529
00:41:22,146 --> 00:41:23,439
Di ko sana sasabihin sa 'yo,

530
00:41:25,191 --> 00:41:27,026
pero sa kabila ng feelings niya sa 'yo,

531
00:41:27,109 --> 00:41:28,986
nai-in love na si Jae-i sa scholar.

532
00:41:32,239 --> 00:41:34,450
Kita ko sa mga mata niya.

533
00:41:34,950 --> 00:41:38,329
Kung hahayaan mo 'to,
di mo na mababawi si Jae-i.

534
00:42:01,185 --> 00:42:04,146
Akala ko nadala ko lahat,
pero nakalimutan ko 'yong antacids.

535
00:42:04,230 --> 00:42:06,232
Pwede na 'yong tatlong pack.

536
00:42:10,653 --> 00:42:11,737
Kang Ha.

537
00:42:12,363 --> 00:42:15,449
Ikaw ang pinapapunta ko
para di ka mapaaway.

538
00:42:16,242 --> 00:42:17,660
Salamat sa concern.

539
00:42:17,743 --> 00:42:20,412
Iisipin mong duwag ako,
pero gano'n talaga dito.

540
00:42:20,913 --> 00:42:23,749
Pinipilit ko lang na kayanin.

541
00:42:23,832 --> 00:42:25,459
Di mo kailangang magpaliwanag.

542
00:42:25,543 --> 00:42:28,128
Puro duwag na matatanda
at mga baliw na bata ang nandito.

543
00:42:29,129 --> 00:42:31,090
Ni ayoko nang malaman kung bakit.

544
00:42:47,439 --> 00:42:48,524
Uy.

545
00:42:48,607 --> 00:42:50,109
Diyos ko, tinakot mo 'ko.

546
00:42:50,192 --> 00:42:51,235
Okay ka lang ba?

547
00:42:52,820 --> 00:42:53,779
Lalabas ka?

548
00:42:54,363 --> 00:42:56,824
Oo. May bibilhin ako sa botika.

549
00:43:00,035 --> 00:43:02,246
Tara. Kailangan kong bumili ng sigarilyo.

550
00:43:02,913 --> 00:43:04,081
Ano?

551
00:43:04,164 --> 00:43:06,166
Ano? Gusto mo ikaw ang umangkas?

552
00:43:10,379 --> 00:43:11,505
Si Jae-i ba 'yon?

553
00:43:15,301 --> 00:43:16,260
Siya nga.

554
00:43:16,343 --> 00:43:17,761
At 'yong scholar.

555
00:43:18,554 --> 00:43:19,555
Nakahawak ka na?

556
00:43:59,970 --> 00:44:00,929
Nakakapanibago.

557
00:44:02,056 --> 00:44:03,515
Ha? Ano?

558
00:44:03,599 --> 00:44:04,433
Ano 'yon?

559
00:44:06,226 --> 00:44:08,062
Titingnan mo 'yong dagat? Titigil ako?

560
00:44:08,646 --> 00:44:10,773
Hindi. Okay lang. Deretso lang.

561
00:44:12,232 --> 00:44:13,067
Okay.

562
00:45:06,912 --> 00:45:07,913
Gusto mong isuot 'to?

563
00:45:09,540 --> 00:45:10,791
Hindi. Okay lang ako.

564
00:45:18,006 --> 00:45:19,925
Tingin ko di 'to agad titigil.

565
00:45:31,645 --> 00:45:32,771
Ang cute!

566
00:45:46,660 --> 00:45:47,536
Maganda ka.

567
00:45:49,121 --> 00:45:50,164
Ano?

568
00:45:51,582 --> 00:45:53,083
Maganda ka pag tumatawa.

569
00:45:55,002 --> 00:45:56,837
Ngayon lang kita nakitang tumawa.

570
00:46:03,802 --> 00:46:05,095
Bigla akong na-curious.

571
00:46:05,888 --> 00:46:10,476
Maganda ka, matalino,
at mayaman para makuha anumang gusto mo.

572
00:46:11,185 --> 00:46:12,394
Nasa 'yo na lahat.

573
00:46:13,395 --> 00:46:14,521
Ba't di ka ngumingiti?

574
00:46:16,857 --> 00:46:18,275
Gano'n ako pinalaki.

575
00:46:20,903 --> 00:46:23,071
"Wag basta tumawa o umiyak."

576
00:46:23,739 --> 00:46:26,074
"Nagiging tsismis
'yong walang ingat na tawa."

577
00:46:26,575 --> 00:46:31,246
"Pag nakita kang umiiyak kahit saan,
magiging dahilan 'to ng pagkawasak mo."

578
00:46:32,289 --> 00:46:34,166
Teka, tinuturo talaga sa inyo 'yon?

579
00:46:35,167 --> 00:46:36,919
Oo, mula three years old.

580
00:46:40,589 --> 00:46:43,133
Kung ano-ano talaga natututunan
ng mayayaman.

581
00:46:46,178 --> 00:46:47,179
E, ikaw?

582
00:46:47,262 --> 00:46:51,225
Ba't lagi kang nakangiti pag binu-bully ka
dahil mahirap ka?

583
00:46:52,184 --> 00:46:53,018
Ako?

584
00:46:53,811 --> 00:46:54,728
Di ako mahirap.

585
00:46:56,647 --> 00:47:00,067
Di ko naisip na mahirap o miserable ako.

586
00:47:00,150 --> 00:47:00,984
Hanggang sa…

587
00:47:07,825 --> 00:47:08,992
dumating ako dito.

588
00:47:23,757 --> 00:47:25,592
Di tumitigil 'yong ulan. Tara na.

589
00:47:26,176 --> 00:47:28,220
Uy, Jae-i. Hintayin mo 'ko.

590
00:47:28,303 --> 00:47:29,555
Oo nga pala. 'Yong bike.

591
00:47:31,890 --> 00:47:32,724
Jae-i.

592
00:47:33,475 --> 00:47:34,309
Uy, Jae-i!

593
00:47:35,102 --> 00:47:36,019
Sandali.

594
00:47:38,105 --> 00:47:40,065
Isuot mo 'to. Sispunin ka.

595
00:47:43,026 --> 00:47:43,861
Ayan.

596
00:47:47,739 --> 00:47:48,574
Jae-i.

597
00:47:50,868 --> 00:47:51,785
Buwisit.

598
00:48:02,045 --> 00:48:04,798
Pagdating niya,
hawakan n'yo agad sa braso.

599
00:48:04,882 --> 00:48:08,468
Bugbugin natin o magsindi tayo
ng apoy dito tapos ikulong siya.

600
00:48:09,261 --> 00:48:11,179
Kailangang iligpit siya, anumang mangyari.

601
00:48:12,681 --> 00:48:13,515
Kuha n'yo?

602
00:48:15,225 --> 00:48:16,059
Sumagot…

603
00:48:21,690 --> 00:48:22,691
Pasok ka na.

604
00:48:23,442 --> 00:48:24,359
Ito…

605
00:48:27,529 --> 00:48:29,823
Pumasok ka at patuyuin mo.
May steam closet ako.

606
00:48:35,829 --> 00:48:37,581
Ang ganda talaga dito.

607
00:48:38,540 --> 00:48:40,626
Milyong won kada gabi 'yong mga suite.

608
00:48:40,709 --> 00:48:42,711
Kailan kaya ako makaka-stay sa mga 'yon?

609
00:48:42,794 --> 00:48:44,421
Walang kuwenta 'yong ilang milyon.

610
00:48:44,504 --> 00:48:47,299
'Yong mga villa nina Ri-an at Jae-i
halos sampung milyong won.

611
00:48:47,382 --> 00:48:49,801
Wow. Masarap sigurong ipanganak
na mayaman.

612
00:48:50,510 --> 00:48:53,680
Sayang lang at di sila ipinanganak
na may manners.

613
00:48:53,764 --> 00:48:56,224
Inuutusan nila 'yong teachers nila
na parang katulong.

614
00:48:57,434 --> 00:49:00,562
-Ewan ko kung tatagal pa 'ko.
-Di ba mas malala sa 'yo, Ms. Han?

615
00:49:01,271 --> 00:49:04,399
Nasa klase mo sina Ri-an, He-ra, Jae-i,
pati si Woo-jin…

616
00:49:05,025 --> 00:49:06,735
Mahihirapan akong magtrabaho no'n.

617
00:49:08,111 --> 00:49:09,905
Okay naman 'yong mga batang 'yon.

618
00:49:10,697 --> 00:49:12,950
'Yong iba ang gumagawa ng gulo.

619
00:49:13,617 --> 00:49:14,451
Uy.

620
00:49:22,668 --> 00:49:25,128
Ms. Han? Hinahanap po kayo ng principal.

621
00:49:26,755 --> 00:49:27,756
Okay.

622
00:49:29,424 --> 00:49:30,300
Excuse me, kasi…

623
00:49:30,384 --> 00:49:31,760
-Sige lang.
-Sige.

624
00:49:34,930 --> 00:49:38,725
Ba't hahanapin ni Principal Park
si Ms. Han sa ganitong oras?

625
00:49:40,143 --> 00:49:42,354
-Malay natin. Uminom ka na lang.
-Okay.

626
00:49:46,191 --> 00:49:47,359
May problema ba?

627
00:49:48,860 --> 00:49:50,779
Di sinasagot ng girlfriend ko 'yong phone.

628
00:49:52,656 --> 00:49:54,950
Iniwan ko phone ko sa kuwarto
para mag-charge.

629
00:49:57,244 --> 00:50:00,580
Pero hinahanap ba talaga ako
ni Principal Park?

630
00:50:03,041 --> 00:50:05,502
Nagbukas ako ng wine.
Do'n tayo sa room ko.

631
00:50:39,661 --> 00:50:41,121
Nasa'n ba siya?

632
00:50:41,705 --> 00:50:43,206
Ano ba'ng problema ng gagong 'to?

633
00:50:44,458 --> 00:50:45,834
Nalaman ba niya at umalis na?

634
00:50:45,917 --> 00:50:49,171
I-message mo 'yong iba na hanapin siya.

635
00:50:49,671 --> 00:50:51,339
Nasa'n ba 'yong dalawang 'yon?

636
00:50:51,423 --> 00:50:54,384
Ilang oras na ba tayong naghihintay dito?

637
00:51:00,098 --> 00:51:01,683
Hubarin mo 'yan at isuot mo 'to.

638
00:51:01,767 --> 00:51:05,979
Okay lang. Di naman gaanong basa.
Aalis ako pag natuyo na 'yong damit ko.

639
00:51:08,148 --> 00:51:09,107
Bahala ka.

640
00:51:14,863 --> 00:51:17,282
Close ba sina Jae-i at Kang Ha?

641
00:51:18,366 --> 00:51:19,201
Sino?

642
00:51:19,284 --> 00:51:21,036
'Yong bagong scholar.

643
00:51:21,119 --> 00:51:23,080
A, 'yong pasaway na scholar?

644
00:51:24,414 --> 00:51:25,373
Ba't mo naitanong?

645
00:51:26,208 --> 00:51:29,503
DRYING

646
00:51:49,648 --> 00:51:51,274
Kung inaantok ka, matulog ka na.

647
00:51:52,984 --> 00:51:54,444
Hindi. Di ako inaantok.

648
00:52:22,597 --> 00:52:25,267
Nagustuhan ko rin.

649
00:52:26,768 --> 00:52:27,602
Ano?

650
00:52:30,480 --> 00:52:32,607
Noong araw na 'yon,
no'ng hinalikan mo ako…

651
00:52:36,862 --> 00:52:38,572
nagustuhan ko rin 'yon.

652
00:53:30,165 --> 00:53:31,875
Magkasama? Saan?

653
00:53:35,045 --> 00:53:38,465
Sa villa ni Jae-i.
Nakita ko silang magkasamang pumasok.

654
00:53:38,548 --> 00:53:39,507
Magkasama?

655
00:53:42,719 --> 00:53:43,553
Sigurado ka?

656
00:53:44,346 --> 00:53:47,182
Oo. Nakita ko silang papasok.

657
00:53:51,269 --> 00:53:52,103
Tingin ko…

658
00:53:58,985 --> 00:54:00,237
Babalik ako.

659
00:54:01,363 --> 00:54:02,197
Okay.

660
00:54:04,282 --> 00:54:05,992
Nasaan ka, Principal Park?

661
00:54:07,244 --> 00:54:09,663
Pumunta ka dito ngayon
dala 'yong master key.

662
00:54:49,577 --> 00:54:50,412
Tutulungan kita.

663
00:55:19,691 --> 00:55:20,734
Ano'ng nangyayari?

664
00:55:22,736 --> 00:55:24,404
Ano'ng ginagawa mo?

665
00:56:02,859 --> 00:56:06,696
PERSONAL INFORMATION FORM
KANG HA

666
00:56:46,236 --> 00:56:47,070
Ang lala talaga

667
00:56:48,279 --> 00:56:49,322
ng mga taong 'to.

668
00:56:49,989 --> 00:56:52,325
Ha? Nagsasalita pala ang multo.

669
00:56:52,409 --> 00:56:54,119
Ba't ka pa pumasok?

670
00:56:54,202 --> 00:56:55,537
Mae-expel ka rin naman.

671
00:56:56,204 --> 00:56:57,038
Talaga.

672
00:56:57,122 --> 00:57:00,417
Ang lakas ng loob ng isang scholar
na pasukin 'yong room ni Jae-i?

673
00:57:00,500 --> 00:57:03,628
Wow, akala ko puppy ka lang,
pero stalker ka pala.

674
00:57:03,711 --> 00:57:04,921
Nakakatakot.

675
00:57:05,004 --> 00:57:06,464
Magkano 'yong pustahan natin?

676
00:57:06,548 --> 00:57:08,425
-Ewan ko.
-Limang milyon? Hindi, sampu.

677
00:57:10,593 --> 00:57:11,428
Ri-an.

678
00:57:12,303 --> 00:57:13,388
Saan ka pupunta?

679
00:57:13,471 --> 00:57:15,849
Sa disciplinary hearing? Sasama ako.

680
00:57:16,349 --> 00:57:17,183
Gawin na natin.

681
00:57:18,268 --> 00:57:19,269
'Yon.

682
00:57:19,769 --> 00:57:20,645
Alin 'yon?

683
00:57:20,728 --> 00:57:22,647
'Yong relasyong inaalok ni Yoon He-ra.

684
00:57:23,898 --> 00:57:24,941
Gawin natin.

685
00:57:35,869 --> 00:57:38,246
Sa Healing Forest field trip ngayong taon,

686
00:57:38,329 --> 00:57:41,583
inakusahan kang nanloob
sa kuwarto ni Miss Jung Jae-i.

687
00:57:41,666 --> 00:57:42,876
Kinikilala mo ba 'to?

688
00:57:44,752 --> 00:57:45,879
Sagutin mo ang tanong.

689
00:57:45,962 --> 00:57:47,547
Di na kailangan ang pagtatanong.

690
00:57:47,630 --> 00:57:49,340
Ako mismo ang nakakita.

691
00:57:50,341 --> 00:57:53,136
Ipaliwanag mo man lang
kung pa'no 'yon nangyari, Kang Ha.

692
00:57:53,219 --> 00:57:54,053
Kung sasabihin ko…

693
00:57:56,222 --> 00:57:57,599
maniniwala ba kayo?

694
00:57:58,850 --> 00:57:59,684
Sa Jooshin,

695
00:57:59,767 --> 00:58:03,855
mas mahigpit ang pagsunod sa school rules
kaysa sa ibang school sa Korea.

696
00:58:04,939 --> 00:58:06,983
Wala kaming balak na magbigay ng kaluwagan

697
00:58:07,066 --> 00:58:09,027
sa estudyanteng
di nagpapakita ng pagsisisi.

698
00:58:10,320 --> 00:58:12,489
Alinsunod sa Article 12,

699
00:58:12,572 --> 00:58:15,158
sa paninira sa school
at paggawa ng kahalayan,

700
00:58:15,241 --> 00:58:18,661
balak naming i-expel si Kang Ha.

701
00:58:21,915 --> 00:58:23,291
Di siya nanloob.

702
00:58:23,374 --> 00:58:24,542
Pinapunta ko siya.

703
00:58:25,502 --> 00:58:26,711
Miss Jae-i.

704
00:58:26,794 --> 00:58:30,590
Nagpadala ako ng kailangan ko,
at dumaan lang siya do'n.

705
00:58:31,257 --> 00:58:32,926
Kaya kung may kailangang parusahan,

706
00:58:34,552 --> 00:58:35,845
parusahan n'yo ako.

707
00:58:36,888 --> 00:58:37,722
Tumayo ka.

708
00:58:38,932 --> 00:58:40,016
Sandali lang…

709
00:58:43,061 --> 00:58:44,312
Lumabag siya sa rules.

710
00:58:45,230 --> 00:58:48,942
Magre-request ako ng mahigpit na parusa
para maibalik ang kaayusan sa school.

711
00:58:50,610 --> 00:58:51,945
Ano'ng ginagawa mo, Jae-i?

712
00:58:53,404 --> 00:58:55,365
Tinatanong kita kung ano'ng ginagawa mo.

713
00:58:59,827 --> 00:59:01,162
Lubayan n'yo si Kang Ha.

714
00:59:03,122 --> 00:59:03,998
Ano?

715
00:59:04,082 --> 00:59:06,834
Di ako nage-exaggerate.
At di ko rin siya ginagamit.

716
00:59:12,840 --> 00:59:14,384
Gusto ko siya.

717
00:59:18,972 --> 00:59:20,473
Kaya wag mo siyang pakialaman.

718
00:59:21,933 --> 00:59:22,892
Tumigil ka.

719
00:59:26,062 --> 00:59:28,815
Jooshin 'to, Jung Jae-i.

720
00:59:30,858 --> 00:59:32,735
Wag kang gagawa ng di mo kaya.

721
00:59:33,653 --> 00:59:35,238
Jooshin o hindi…

722
00:59:37,448 --> 00:59:39,867
ako si Jung Jae-i, Kim Ri-an.

723
01:00:03,975 --> 01:00:05,018
Ba't mo ginawa 'yon?

724
01:00:14,360 --> 01:00:15,445
Kaya kong harapin 'yon.

725
01:00:15,528 --> 01:00:18,656
Ngayon, pag-uusapan ka nila dahil sa 'kin.

726
01:00:19,157 --> 01:00:20,033
Kang Ha.

727
01:00:23,494 --> 01:00:24,996
Ba't ka talaga pumunta dito?

728
01:00:38,676 --> 01:00:39,844
Nalaman mo na

729
01:00:40,887 --> 01:00:41,804
kung sino ako.

730
01:05:15,953 --> 01:05:19,874
Nagsalin ng Subtitle: Ivy Grace Quinto

